{
  "name": "Scrape Y Combinator Startup Founders with Direct Personal LinkedIn & X/Twitter Links",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Scrape Y Combinator Startup Founders with Direct Personal LinkedIn & X/Twitter Links\n\n**Actor:** [Y Combinator (YC) Startups & Founders Scraper: LinkedIn, X & Batch Data](https://apify.com/storeintel/y-combinator-startups-founders-scraper)\n\n### What this workflow does\nExtract structured Y Combinator startup profiles (batch, status, team headcount, website, tags) and emit individual founder B2B lead records with direct personal LinkedIn and X/Twitter URLs.\n\n### Who is this for?\n- **B2B Sales & Outbound Agencies** building targeted prospect lists.\n- **RevOps & Growth Teams** enriching CRM records automatically.\n- **Market Researchers** tracking pricing, reviews, and hiring velocity.\n\n### Pre-Built Specialized Apify Tasks\n- [YC Founder LinkedIn & X/Twitter B2B Leads Scraper](https://apify.com/storeintel/yc-founder-linkedin-twitter-b2b-leads-scraper)\n- [Y Combinator AI Startups & Batch Directory Scraper](https://apify.com/storeintel/y-combinator-w24-s24-ai-startups-directory-scraper)\n- [YC Startup Team Size, Website & Socials Scraper](https://apify.com/storeintel/yc-startup-team-size-hiring-status-scraper)",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 460,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "sticky-overview-7",
      "name": "Workflow Overview & Use Case",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        120,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 1: Configuration & Apify Setup\n\n1. Create a free account or sign in at [Apify Store — StoreIntel Labs](https://apify.com/storeintel/y-combinator-startups-founders-scraper).\n2. Copy your personal API Token from **Apify Console → Settings → Integrations**.\n3. Open the **1. Set Apify Token & Target Parameters** node below and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n4. Customize the target URLs, slugs, or search keywords in the JSON payload.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "sticky-setup-7",
      "name": "Setup Instructions",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        620,
        160
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Step 2: Lead Qualification & Export\n\n- **Filter Qualified B2B Leads:** Automatically removes empty or incomplete records before writing to your CRM.\n- **Map CRM & Outreach Fields:** Normalizes fields into a clean table schema.\n- **Append to Google Sheets:** Connect your Google Sheets OAuth2 credential and select your destination spreadsheet (or swap this node for HubSpot, Pipedrive, Instantly, or Slack).",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 560,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "sticky-downstream-7",
      "name": "Qualification & Export Notes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1140,
        160
      ]
    },
